STEP 0 -- setup: make the 4050 the AMF master and let the x230 join                  done
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: configure the master only. The x230 keeps its saved config, which already names
  network Enterprise-AMF and has port1.0.1 as an atmf-link. The two units must agree on the
  management VLAN (3500) and the domain VLAN (1234), so the master gets the same values.
4050-5g# configure terminal
4050-5g(config)# atmf network-name Enterprise-AMF
4050-5g(config)# atmf management vlan 3500
4050-5g(config)# atmf domain vlan 1234
4050-5g(config)# atmf master
4050-5g(config)# interface port1.0.2
4050-5g(config-if)# switchport mode trunk
4050-5g(config-if)# switchport atmf-link
4050-5g(config-if)# end
